{"version":1,"content":"<p>伊朗在霍爾木茲海峽周邊襲擊油輪造成的漏油正蔓延至阿拉伯聯合酋長國（阿聯酋）海岸，導致海灘出現黑色油污，並威脅海龜和海豚的生存。首批抵達阿聯酋海岸的漏油污染導致一個市鎮的近岸海水變黑，並迫使三個酋長國於本周末關閉海灘。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584446.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:57.118325+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:48:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_hash":"8e987b47ce7a4532ee5888aaef7a1a6286e6636ef6017b4e9ca316bccf2c5ab2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}